#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1288
msgid "Figure dumps go in {0}/figures: skylanders, infinity and dimensions. Switch a portal on here, start the game, then put figures on it from the in-game menu (touchpad click + Options > USB devices)."
msgstr "Figuurdumps gaan in {0}/figures: skylanders, infinity en dimensions. Zet hier een portaal aan, start de game en zet er dan figuren op vanuit het gamemenu (touchpadklik + OPTIONS > USB-apparaten)."

#. {0} is the app's version; {1} its data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on; {2} Eden's game files folder, /data/ps5cemu/eden
